          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your body readily accepts and retains minor changes. When you drink one of your alchemical items that has the elixir and infused traits and a duration of 1 minute or more, you can make the elixir's duration indefinite. This can exceed the 10-minute limit of an item made with @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Quick Alchemy]. You can do so only if the elixir's level is half your level or lower. If you later consume a different elixir and make it indefinite, the effect of the previous indefinite elixir ends.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 16
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Extend Elixir"
              }
            ]
          },
